{"articleNo":"56401","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=56401&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"청소년 독도강좌 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.06.04","hit":"4070","attachments":[{"name":"계획(안).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=56401&attachNo=69092"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교통상부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에서는 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">‘청소년 독도 강좌’</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를 다음과 같이 개최한다 하오니 관심있는 학생은 참여하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 행 사 명 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">청소년 독도 강좌</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 목 &nbsp;&nbsp; 적 : 청소년들의 독도 영유권 의식 고취 및 독도 정책 이해</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 장소 및 일시 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교통상부 2층 강당(15:00 ~ 17:00)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(1회당 100여명)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 2012.7.6(금), 8.17(금)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 프로그램&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">독도 영상 시청, 강의, 질의응답 및 수료증 증정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 신청방법&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교부 독도 홈페이지(http://dokdo.mofat.go.kr) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">팝업을 통하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">선착순 신청</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 기 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;타 : 붙임 자료 참고(문의 : 외교통상부 김지영, ☎ 02-2100-0143) </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임 : 청소년 ‘독도강좌’개최계획 1부. 끝. </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
